&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:transparent; color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:11pt"&gt;This year&rsquo;s event will feature a warm, family-friendly breakfast, holiday craft and activity stations, gifts for children from Santa, Military community resource vendors, and Holiday meal giveaways.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
