&lt;p style="text-align:left"&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;"As the calendar year draws to a close with cadets and permanent party preparing for the holiday season, we are taking stock of a demanding but decisive year and our solemn responsibility of forging warrior-leaders for our nation,&rdquo; said &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;Lt. Gen. Tony Bauernfeind. &ldquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;As we look back on the year, we are exceptionally proud of the entire USAFA team for enacting purposeful transformation and delivering excellence, all while overcoming various challenges."&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
